WEBVTT

00:07:58.015 --> 00:08:00.059
And the next step

00:08:00.059 --> 00:08:01.977
is going into mass production.

00:08:01.977 --> 00:08:03.187
This is our campus.

00:08:04.063 --> 00:08:08.317
And it's going to be fully powered
by renewables, of course,

00:08:08.317 --> 00:08:12.488
and that's where we'll be tackling
speed, scale and cost.

00:08:14.156 --> 00:08:18.702
By focusing on one single core size,

00:08:18.702 --> 00:08:21.705
we can leverage massive economies of scale

00:08:21.747 --> 00:08:24.708
and drive down the price
of green hydrogen.

00:08:25.042 --> 00:08:27.169
Because that’s what it’s all about:

00:08:27.211 --> 00:08:30.714
making green hydrogen cheaper
than fossil fuels.